    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「今日は『君咲カジノ』なんてものに付きあわせちゃったうえに、おうちまで送ってもらっちゃって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「子供じゃないんだから、ひとりで帰れたのに。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「なんていうのも、水臭いわよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「いつも、ありがとね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「う～、今日は慣れないことしたから疲れたわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「ちょっとベッドに倒れこんだら、動けなくなっちゃった……。見送りは、しなくてもいい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「うん。このまま、寝ちゃおうかなって……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「部屋の電気だけ、消しといてね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「下の階にアニキとか、オヤジとかいるけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「帰りが遅かったことについて質問責めにされちゃうかもだけど、てきとうに言い訳しといて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あたしはもう、そんな根気ないわ。ぐったり、疲れきっちゃった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「明日のことを考えると、憂鬱だし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「梅園、怒りすぎて逆にもう冷静になっちゃったのか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「『明日ちゃんと話しましょう』って、みょうに押し殺したような声で言ってたし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「やだなぁ。ぜったい、長々とお説教される～……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「仕方ないけどね、すごく心配させちゃったし。猫塚とふたりで、明日きっちり謝ることにするわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「そう、ぜんぶ、明日にして……。今日はもう、おやすみ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「………♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（あぁ、何だか……。『君咲カジノ』がやたら騒がしかったせいか、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（静かな自分の部屋にいると寂しいわ。転校生、もう帰っちゃったかしら）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（もうすこし、お喋りしていたかった気がするわ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（でももう無理ね、あたしもあいつも『お疲れさま』だし。また平日になれば、二年Ａ組で会えるしね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（不思議な経験、しちゃったわね。ぜんぶ、夢だったみたい）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（転校生がきてから、こんなのばっかりよ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ほんと、あいつと初めて会ったときに言ったことが、現実になっちゃったわ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（とんだ、お騒がせな転校生よね……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（まぁ……。ぜんぶがぜんぶ、あいつのせいじゃないけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（『君咲カジノ』かぁ。そんなものが学校にできるなんて、去年は考えもしなかったわよ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（おかしな事態ばかり起きて、ついてけないわ。ほんと、毎日がお祭り騒ぎね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（でも、楽しかったわ。また明日も、梅園にネチネチ言われたあと……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ストレス発散に、『君咲カジノ』へ遊びに行っちゃおうかしら？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ちょっと、はまっちゃってる……。不思議ね。あたしギャンブルなんて生涯、縁がないと思ってたのに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（いろんな喜びが、幸せが、あたしの知らないことが『いっぱい』あるのよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ぜんぶ引っくるめて、青春だわ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（いつか、遠い未来に、この日々がぜんぶ良い思い出になってるわ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（宝石みたいに、きらきら輝くのよ……。そうよね、転校生）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（うう。ほんとに、寝そう……。でも汗かいてるし、シャワーだけ浴びちゃいたい。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（制服も着替えないと、しわになっちゃうし。ん～、よし！　いったん起きる！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ぜんぶ明日に回しちゃえるほど、器用じゃないもの。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（こういう性格なのよ、モヤモヤしちゃって眠れない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「ふあ、あ……。ん～、階下が騒がしいわね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「転校生、アニキたちに変なこと言われてなきゃいいけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「うあ、髪の毛ぼっさぼさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「ていうか。こんな無防備に寝転んでるとこ、転校生に見られちゃったわけね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「う～、ちょっと気ぃ抜きすぎ？　駄目ね、もっとしっかりしないと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（あら？　何かしら、見覚えのない紙袋が……転校生の忘れもの？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ふむ。『チップと引き換えに、そして労働の対価として景品を進呈します／君咲カジノ支配人』って？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（あぁ、ディーラーとして働いたし、ブラックジャックでそこそこ儲けたからね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（景品って何かしら、えぇっと？　大量のお菓子と、これは……衣装？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（んん？　これって、ばにぃがぁる……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（『ディーラーとしての腕前を見込んで、これを進呈します。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（また客としてでも店員としてでも、いつでも君咲カジノにおいでくださいまし』……って？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ん～。評価されたのは嬉しいけど、ディーラーはともかくバニーガールはちょっと……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（せっかくだから、もらっとくけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（こんなもの、着る機会はなさそうだわ。タンスの、肥やしになっちゃいそう……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（サイズあうかどうか、わかんないし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（ちょっと、試着してみようかしら）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "（サイズあわなかったら、返品して……。）"
